{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to Nightmare House. Delve into an action-packed first-person horror experience based on the legendary Half-Life 2 horror mod &quot;Nightmare House 2&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/494e9afb27cc36b8b665565d0ed5f1d2.poster.avif?t=1772211719\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/494e9afb27cc36b8b665565d0ed5f1d2.webm?t=1772211719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/494e9afb27cc36b8b665565d0ed5f1d2.mp4?t=1772211719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEGEND, REIMAGINED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tread through an abandoned house haunted by the nightmares of its former occupants. You are trapped inside with a powerful entity named Emily \u2013 make peace, build trust, and unravel her past, present and future as you desperately seek an escape from this twisted reality. The only way out is through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW OLD SCHOOL HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare House is a true early 2000s horror experience. Return to the gameplay you know and love with new mechanics that add complexity and depth. Explore, fight, and survive in this reimagining of the original game\u2019s house chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/169fe206618ea3b83a95b3d46df46101.poster.avif?t=1772211719\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/169fe206618ea3b83a95b3d46df46101.webm?t=1772211719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/extras/169fe206618ea3b83a95b3d46df46101.mp4?t=1772211719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT WITH AN EDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a unique directional attack system, wade into visceral melee combat with your trusty axe. When you can't get up close and personal, engage in satisfying gunplay with an arsenal of weapons. Bullets are scarce, so make every shot count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Than Ever:</strong> The original creators of &quot;Nightmare House&quot; and &quot;In Sound Mind&quot; are back to re-envision and elevate the Nightmare House experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypnotizing Mystery:</strong> Piece together her forgotten memories. Don\u2019t b\u0337\u0359\u0301e\u0337\u035a\u030a a\u0335\u0352f\u0338r\u0335a\u0337i\u0336\u030ad\u0337\u030d. \u1e8e\u0335\u032co\u0335\u0339\u030du\u0336'\u0335\u0332\u0313r\u0337e\u0334\u0314 \u0335\u035a\u030f\u1e48\u0335\u0358O\u0337\u0317\u030dT\u0335\u033c\u034b \u0334\u0356\u0300a\u0337l\u0334\u031c\u0313o\u0338\u035bn\u0334\u034e\u033de\u0336\u0312</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additive Scare System:</strong> Dynamic nightmares keep you guessing; you never know what could be around the next corner.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by The Living Tombstone:</strong> As part of the original core team, the popular EDM group TLT returns with another heart-pumping soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Sleepless Night:</strong> Experience a 3-4 hour campaign set entirely inside the Nightmare House. Uncover new secrets, dangers, and deep lore.</p></li></ul>","ba