&quot;In Sound Mind&quot; are back to re-envision and elevate the Nightmare House experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypnotizing Mystery:</strong> Piece together her forgotten memories. Don\u2019t b\u0337\u0359\u0301e\u0337\u035a\u030a a\u0335\u0352f\u0338r\u0335a\u0337i\u0336\u030ad\u0337\u030d. \u1e8e\u0335\u032co\u0335\u0339\u030du\u0336'\u0335\u0332\u0313r\u0337e\u0334\u0314 \u0335\u035a\u030f\u1e48\u0335\u0358O\u0337\u0317\u030dT\u0335\u033c\u034b \u0334\u0356\u0300a\u0337l\u0334\u031c\u0313o\u0338\u035bn\u0334\u034e\u033de\u0336\u0312</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additive Scare System:</strong> Dynamic nightmares keep you guessing; you never know what could be around the next corner.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by The Living Tombstone:</strong> As part of the original core team, the popular EDM group TLT returns with another heart-pumping soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Sleepless Night:</strong> Experience a 3-4 hour campaign set entirely inside the Nightmare House. Uncover new secrets, dangers, and deep lore.</p></li></ul>","developers":["We Create Stuff"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744430/4b84b869f5c3b928ea5a462dc5ef2d75e8679355/header.jpg?t=1772211719","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Nightmare House: Reimagined \u00a9 2024 We Create Stuff Inc. Nightmare House\u2122, Nightmare House: Reimagined\u2122, We Create Stuff\u2122, and their respective logos are trademarks of We Create Stuff Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme